	)
	(text "INHIBIT high turns the port off. Low / MCU reset leaves normal hub and attach control.\nEach drain clamps SW_EN in parallel with that port's existing attach transistor.\nPlace each FET and gate pulldown near its port power switch. All resistors: 0402."
		(at 25.4 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
